Revision history for Browser-OIDC

0.004     2026-11-12 15:22:01+0100
          - Switch to using Mojolicious
          - Check iss response parameter before checking error/code
          - Correctly trigger basic authentication
          - Add client_id when client_auth_method=none
          - Handle absent claims_supported and scopes_supported more gracefully
          - Decode JSON in userinfo
          - Cache JWKS

0.003     2026-11-07 20:31:29+0100
          - Split new into new_from_discovery and new_from_config (BREAKING)
          - Always add nonce to authorization request
          - Don't send any client_secret in authorization request
          - Force certificate verification in HTTPS requests
          - Always include PKCE
          - Harden response checking code
          - Add userinfo method to TokenResponse
          - Add timeout to local HTTP daemon
          - URI escape basic authentication id and secret
          - Handle failure to open browser more gracefully
          - Handle authorization server issuer identification
          - Mandate use of client_id

0.002     2026-09-15 13:11:47+0200
          - Add TokenResponse class
          - Use a lot more of the Open ID Connect configuration
          - Add display, prompt, nonce and max_age arguments
          - Add issuer, claims_supported and scopes_supported methods
          - Add jwks method

0.001     2026-09-03 16:12:02+0200
          - Initial release to an unsuspecting world

